Announcements: Support, Features and Job Opportunities! 
 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌


Hi! 

Maddie from Originality.AI here...

We value your business so much and we're dedicated to providing you with
the best possible experience while using our Software.  We're excited
to announce a couple of things that we hope will help us do that! 

* Introducing Our Enhanced Customer Support Solution!

* Announcing our Multilanguage Feature coming soon! 

* We're Hiring! 

**Customer support: **

We're excited to share that we've revamped and integrated some robust
customer support software to ensure that all of your questions and
concerns are answered promptly. Our expanded team has been trained and
is now ready to assist you. They can be reached at
**support@originality.ai** <mailto:support@originality.ai> or VIA the
live chat inside of the application ( see below). 

  

**Sneak Peek: Multilanguage Feature in 14 Languages: **

Soon, we will be rolling out our new Multilanguage Feature, designed to
cater to the diverse global community that is at the heart of
Originality.AI!

With support for 14 languages, we're breaking down barriers to
make sure that more people feel at home and heard while using our
Tools. 

The languages are will be available with this release are: 

* Spanish

* Turkish

* Italian

* French

* Russian

* German

* Portuguese 

* Dutch

* Chinese ( Mandarin) 

* Greek

* Polish 

* Vietnamese

* Japanese 

* Persian

**We're Hiring! **

We know that our community is made up of many individuals with diverse
linguistic backgrounds. If you are bilingual and excited about our new
Multilanguage Feature, we would love to work with you! 

We are currently looking to hire a Marketing Coordinator for each
language available in the Multilanguage Feature release listed above.
Your assistance in helping us go to market in your native language would
be invaluable.

If this sounds in your wheelhouse, please send your resume to
maddie@originality.ai <mailto:maddie@originality.ai>  

Thanks for reading! 

Sent to: patriogabrielpatdu@gmail.com

